<p style="font-size:0.95rem; color:var(--text-muted); margin-bottom:20px;">
  My research interests lie broadly in Machine Learning, Deep Learning,
  and mathematical methods for structured data. One of my recent projects
  applied Persistent Homology to plant phenotype analysis, using topological
  descriptors and ML classifiers to study genotype differences.
</p>


